# Un-ignore what this directory is for.
#
# The repository root ignores several patterns globally that the layout of this
# experiment depends on. A rule here wins for paths under this directory, so
# each one is re-included deliberately and nothing else is.

# `output/` (root rule `output/`) is where the owner commits each run's small
# result files.
!output/

# `plots/` receives one PNG per question from the analysis scripts (root rule
# `*.png`). A phase report whose figures exist only on the machine that ran the
# analysis is not a record, so they are committed with the tables they came
# from.
!plots/*.png

# `run.log` is on the hand-back list for every run (root rule `*.log`). Without
# this it was dropped silently: the first three runs came back with `.err`
# files, which nothing ignores, and no `run.log` at all.
!output/**/*.log

# Deliberately still ignored, and not re-included here: `*.nc`, because the
# NetCDF diagnostics stay on Levante scratch and `provenance.txt` is what points
# back to them, and `*.out`, because the job's own output is trimmed into
# `run.log` rather than committed whole.
